<title>UK: All four Brent cargoes turning wet kept - trade.</title>
<headline>All four Brent cargoes turning wet kept - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>All four of the Brent blend crude cargoes emerging from the paper chains on Friday were kept ahead of the five o'clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>One July 12-14 loader was kept by U.S. refiner and trader Koch, while the other was held onto by J.Aron.</p>
<p>A July 13-15 cargo was kept by French major Elf and a July 14-16 loader was kept by trading house Arcadia, the sources said.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
